# Laprdus: Slovenian speech symbols that correct NVDA's own table.
# NVDA's locale/sl/symbols.dic gives the Slovenian quotation marks » and «
# the level "none", so they are spoken at every punctuation level, even
# with punctuation off; every other quotation mark, and these two in the
# English table, have the level "most". A listener reported them spoken
# with the punctuation off (2026-11-03). The names are NVDA's own without
# the stray English word "double".
symbols:
«	dvojni začetni narekovaj	most	always
»	dvojni zaključni narekovaj	most	always
